property done, flo
global glob

on startStep me
  [  0] pushzero ................................ <0>
  [  1] setprop 66 .............................. done = 0
  [  3] getglobal 8 ............................. <glob>
  [  5] getchainedprop 9 ........................ <glob.managers>
  [  7] getchainedprop 10 ....................... <glob.managers.game>
  [  9] getchainedprop 11 ....................... <glob.managers.game.room>
  [ 11] getobjprop 79 ........................... <glob.managers.game.room.waiter>
  [ 13] setprop 78 .............................. flo = glob.managers.game.room.waiter
  [ 15] getprop 78 .............................. <flo>
  [ 17] pushsymb 85 ............................. <#payload>
  [ 19] pusharglist 2 ........................... <flo, #payload>
  [ 21] objcall 59 .............................. <flo.payload.count>
  [ 23] jmpifz [ 30] ............................ if flo.payload.count then
  [ 26] pusharglistnoret 0 ...................... <>
  [ 28] extcall 44 .............................. return 
  [ 30] pushint8 1 .............................. <1>
  [ 32] pusharglistnoret 1 ...................... <1>
  [ 34] extcall 44 .............................. return 1
  [ 36] ret
end

on checkDone me
  [  0] getprop 66 .............................. <done>
  [  2] getprop 78 .............................. <flo>
  [  4] pusharglist 1 ........................... <flo>
  [  6] extcall 26 .............................. <voidp(flo)>
  [  8] or ...................................... <done or voidp(flo)>
  [  9] jmpifz [ 16] ............................ if done or voidp(flo) then
  [ 12] pusharglistnoret 0 ...................... <>
  [ 14] extcall 44 .............................. return 
  [ 16] getprop 78 .............................. <flo>
  [ 18] pushsymb 86 ............................. <#food>
  [ 20] pusharglist 2 ........................... <flo, #food>
  [ 22] objcall 101 ............................. <flo.getPayload(#food)>
  [ 24] getobjprop 59 ........................... <flo.getPayload(#food).count>
  [ 26] pushint8 2 .............................. <2>
  [ 28] eq ...................................... <flo.getPayload(#food).count = 2>
  [ 29] setprop 66 .............................. done = flo.getPayload(#food).count = 2
  [ 31] getprop 66 .............................. <done>
  [ 33] pusharglistnoret 1 ...................... <done>
  [ 35] extcall 44 .............................. return done
  [ 37] ret
end
